    </div>
    <ol class="capture-pipeline">
      <li><b>Target</b><span>Page or driver session</span></li>
      <li><b>Adapter</b><span>Accessible browser state</span></li>
      <li><b>Core</b><span>Validate, retry, transform</span></li>
      <li><b>Snapshot</b><span>Schema 2 or TQ1</span></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

